WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.395
Some cleaning shortcuts make a dataset look better
while reducing its truthfulness A

00:00:06.409 --> 00:00:12.039
bad date should not become today's date A negative
price should not become

00:00:12.065 --> 00:00:17.982
positive without evidence A missing phone should
remain missing unless a reliable

00:00:18.009 --> 00:00:23.824
source provides one A possible duplicate should not
be deleted just because

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:29.428
its ID is larger Cleaning should preserve
uncertainty when the truth is

00:00:29.454 --> 00:00:29.954
unknown
